Subject: [PATCH] Frontend: fold the home screen's cities under continent
 dropdowns

- Each continent opens and closes with a click; its countries and cities rise in one by one
- Search opens every continent with a match; the last city's continent opens on return
- Keyboard and screen-reader friendly (aria-expanded, hidden content is not focusable)
- lib/continents.ts groups cities; a test fails if a fetched country has no continent

